this reduces to `j_{x|x+1}(ξ) = −[h_{x,x+1}, q_x(ξ)] = [h_{x,x+1}, q_{x+1}(ξ)]`.
*(r2: the r1 definition was the nearest-neighbour formula while (H4) quantified
