**(b) Continuity equation.** `[H, q_x(ξ)] = j_{x−1|x}(ξ) − j_{x|x+1}(ξ)`
(proved in corner-a-goldstone.md ⟨1⟩6); this is the exact lattice conservation law.

**(c) Modulated charge and current.** For `f ∈ 𝔉_c(ξ)`,
