+- Negative correction: do not merge D34(c)'s `phi`-orbit period or P6's
+  nonscalar lower bound; (3.2) makes them identically zero.
+- Replace the proposed L2 scalar iff by the de Rham flux criterion (3.1), and
+  record ⟨1⟩9 as a counterexample to virtual-scalar necessity.
+- Strengthen `(FS-conv)` to `C^1_loc` convergence plus local nondegeneracy if
+  L2 is meant to produce a smooth Poisson bracket.
+- No statement here authorizes a paper edit; TJO sign-off remains mandatory.
